	"Description": "What this mod does\n<br />\n<br />This mod will replace the Forest Farm map with a new farm hidden deep in the woods. The farm has a clearing surrounded by trees and a secret meadow in the bottom right corner. This is a tiny map good for people who like a relaxed or compact playing style. It's not recommended for multiplayer.\n<br />\n<br />Features\n<br />\n<br />- All grass tiles are diggable/farmable\n<br />- All other aspects of the forest farm are preserved; but since the total area is smaller, you will not see as much forageables\n<br />- The map includes new seasonal forest canopy overlay tiles, and the ER/VPR versions also include extra tiles with grass along the water edge\n<br />- The secret meadow has a trapdoor with an extra cave to balance the farm size\n<br />\n<br />Recolor notes\n<br />\n<br />I've made separate versions of this map which are compatible with the Vibrant Pastoral Recolor and DaisyNiko's Earthy Recolour mods, along with a vanilla version. Download the one that you like best! If you want to use any other recolors, download the vanilla version which should be compatible.\n<br />\n<br />Compatibility\n<br />\n<br />This mod won't be compatible with any other mod that replaces the Forest Farm or Farm Cave maps.",
